{"id":"references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch02_ManifoldsNonNegativeCurvature#lem:busemann-approx-lower-bound","title":"lem:busemann-approx-lower-bound","path":"references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch02_ManifoldsNonNegativeCurvature.md","line":233,"body":"","kind":"lemma","status":"not_started","tex":"references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch02_ManifoldsNonNegativeCurvature.tex#lem:busemann-approx-lower-bound","uses":["[[references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch02_ManifoldsNonNegativeCurvature#def:busemann-approx]]"],"inspired_by":[],"bindings":[],"is_index":false,"body_html":"","formal":[],"tex_content":{"path":"references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch02_ManifoldsNonNegativeCurvature.tex","label":"lem:busemann-approx-lower-bound","line":402,"source":"\\begin{lemma}[Busemann approximants are bounded below]\n\\label{lem:busemann-approx-lower-bound}\n\n\\uses{def:busemann-approx}\n\n\n\nFor $x\\in M$ and $t\\ge0$,\n$$B_{\\lambda,t}(x)\\ge-d(x,\\lambda(0));$$\nin particular $B_{\\lambda,t}(\\lambda(0))=0$.\n\\end{lemma}\n\\begin{proof}\n\\sketch\n\nUse $t=d(\\lambda(0),\\lambda(t))\\le d(\\lambda(0),x)+d(x,\\lambda(t))$.\n\\end{proof}","html":" <p></p><section class=\"theorem\"><div class=\"theorem-label\">Lemma</div></section>[Busemann approximants are bounded below] <span class=\"tex-label\" id=\"tex-label-6c656d3a627573656d616e6e2d617070726f782d6c6f7765722d626f756e64\"></span> <p></p><a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FMorganTian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FCh02_ManifoldsNonNegativeCurvature%23def%3Abusemann-approx\">↗ def:busemann-approx</a> <p></p>For <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$x\\in M$\">$x\\in M$</span> and <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$t\\ge 0$\">$t\\ge 0$</span>, <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"true\" data-tex=\"\\[ B_{\\lambda ,t}(x)\\ge -d(x,\\lambda (0)); \\]\">\\[ B_{\\lambda ,t}(x)\\ge -d(x,\\lambda (0)); \\]</span> in particular <span cla